WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.104
NARRATOR: These safari
tours are about to get

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.572
the sighting of their lives.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.112
Hippo versus bull shark.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:29.763
The strongest bite
force of all mammals

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:34.567
faces off with the strongest
bite force of all sharks.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:39.372
[dramatic music]

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:48.515
Just 150 miles south
of Ryan's study site,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:53.019
at St. Lucia estuary,
one of Africa's

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.423
largest tidal wetlands--

00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:03.396
a watery mix of fresh
and salt. Shallow.

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:06.166
Warm.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:11.037
Just right for bull sharks.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:14.774
And a once in a lifetime
encounter on safari.

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:19.712
[dramatic music]

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:47.240
This shark was probably
chasing a fish when it

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.641
caught the hippos by surprise.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:54.647
Africa's deadliest
large land animal.

